<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n62698" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λευκόν</span></b> , τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>white</i>, as a colour, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ λ. οἶδεν</span> knows <i>white</i> from
			black, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				1279
			</span></i>; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέλαν</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Prt.</u>
				331d
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>a white dress</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λευκὸν
			ἀμπέχει</span> are dressed <i>in white</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ach.</u>
				1024
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠμφιεσμένη λευκά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Th.</u>
					840
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>white of egg</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Nat.Mul.</u>
				32
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>GA</u>
				753a35
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				2.50
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ λ.</span> the <i>whites of the
			eyes</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Prog.</u>
				2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Alex.
				222.9
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				492a1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>5.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ λ.</span> the <i>menstrua alba</i> of
			young girls, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>GA</u>
				738a26
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>HA</u>
				581b2
			</span></i>; more generally, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Prorrh.</u>
				1.80
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Epid.</u>
				4.22
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>6.</b> of a
				<i>white formation</i> in testaceans, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				529a3
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
